        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-862, Bow Pull with Petals and Solid Lines</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Floral Cabinet Pull brings the image of a flower but in a way that is not overly feminine. It is a great choice for traditional homes that want beautifully styled hardware. The Bow Pull with Petals and Solid Lines is available in 5 finishes including satin nickel (pictured) and oil rubbed bronze. It is available in 2 sizes: a 3 inch length and a 5 inch length.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/petals-at-edge-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-759\"><b>Matching Petals at Edge Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-862 Petal Cabinet Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-862</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-863</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/nickel-crab.jpg?v=1704354546\" width=\"497\" height=\"122\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
